  "worked_solution": "The truth set of $\u00acP(x)$ is the *complement* of the truth set of $P(x):$\n\n$$\n{T}_{\u00acP}={\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{P}\n$$\n\nTherefore, to get the truth set of $\u00acP(x),$ we take all the points that belong to $U$ and do not lie in ${T}_{p},$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14099575/assets/bb2a35ad33731bfe5f26960a518a038b21a9445e38e3647a792326e23fd105ad.png)",
